                                "en": "The mother's illness was a great <w>cross</w> for the whole family."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Każdy człowiek musi w życiu dźwigać swój własny <w>krzyż</w>.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Каждый человек должен в жизни нести свой собственный <w>крест</w>.",
                                "en": "Every person must bear their own <w>cross</w> in life."
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "synonyms": [
